responses.user:
Write an HTML page from scratch to display a user's contact information.

name: John Doe;
age: 46;
phone: +1 (312) 555-4879;
email: john.doe@example.com;

responses.response:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contact Information</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .contact-card {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 300px;
        }
        .contact-card h1 {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #333;
        }
        .contact-card p {
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: #666;
        }
        .contact-card strong {
            color: #333;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="contact-card">
        <h1>John Doe</h1>
        <p><strong>Age:</strong> 46</p>
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +1 (312) 555-4879</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> john.doe@example.com</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

